flowchart TB
    Developer[Developer] -->|Dispatch or cancel| Workflow[GitHub Actions on hosted runner]
    Workflow -.->|Assume run role through OIDC| Identity[AWS run identity]
    Workflow -->|Direct calls with run credentials and EKS authorization| API[EKS public API]
    Laptop["Platform maintainer"] --> IaC[Terragrunt and Terraform]
    IaC -->|Create and maintain| Foundation
    subgraph Foundation[Dev foundation on AWS]
        API
        subgraph EKS[EKS cluster]
            Controllers[Platform controllers and k6 Operator]
            subgraph Main[main node group]
                App[Bookinfo services]
            end
            subgraph Load[load-test node group]
                K6[k6 pods in generator namespace]
            end
            subgraph Obser[obser node group]
                Monitoring[Shared Prometheus and Grafana]
            end
        end
        API -->|TestRun watched by k6 Operator| Controllers
        Controllers -->|k6 Operator coordinates run resources; Job controller creates Pods| K6
        K6 -->|HTTP load via selected route| App
        K6 -.->|Remote write| Monitoring
    end
